# Free Cash Daily Check — Cron Schedule
# Edit: config/freecash-crontab
# Location: D:/AgenticOS/config/freecash-crontab

# Run daily at 05:05 UTC (adjust time as needed)
# Format: minute hour dayOfMonth month dayOfWeek command
0 5 * * * /usr/bin/env python3 /path/to/AgenticOS/scripts/make_freecash_check.py >> /path/to/AgenticOS/logs/freecashioc_$(date +\%Y-\%m-\%d).log 2>&1

# Notes:
# - Path to script must be absolute or adjusted to your setup.
# - Output log directory is configured internally by the script.
# - To change time, edit line above; no code changes needed.